+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A7A4C8: the default idle: when the player accepts the conversation it starts the race transition, sets the race state to 1 and switches the BGM to NA_BGM_HORSE.
+void EnIn_OfferFirstRace(EnIn* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A7A4C8 [LLM:HIGH]
